{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04005","headline":"上元夜效小庾体 · 陈嘉言","name":"上元夜效小庾体","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"今夜可怜春，河桥多丽人。\n宝马金爲络，香车玉作轮。\n连手窥潘掾，分头看洛神。\n重城自不掩，出向小平津。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈嘉言","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04005.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04005","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}